there were some differences in ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["MEGA Servers"]},". The most noticeable difference being that all players could only place 16 towers down instead of the usual 20-40, if there were 5+ people in the server. Additionally, the sell costs of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Towers","title":"Towers"},"children":["towers"]}," were less than expected and less money was awarded per player after a wave ends. This meant that you needed to adjust your strategy, especially early-game. Additionally, certain enemies had increased health, such as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Heavy","title":"Heavy"},"children":["Heavy"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwLg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Enemy_Health_Increases"},"children":["Enemy Health Increases"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Enemy scaling only occurred if there were 5+ players in a server. Shield health was not affected. The scaling was as follows:"]},"\n\n",{"type":"table","props":{"id":"mwMA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwMw"},"children":["Enemy"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwNA"},"children":["Scaling per Player"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwNQ"},"children":["5 Players Health"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwNg"},"children":["6 Players Health"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwNw"},"children":["7 Players Health"]},"\n",{"type":"th","props":{"id":"mwOA"},"children":["8 Players Health"]}]},"\n",{"type":"tr","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"td","props":{"id":"mwOg"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Fallen_Swordmaster","title":"Fallen Swordmaster"},"children":["Fallen Swordmaster"]},{"type":"sup","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/MEGA_Servers#cite_note-adm-1"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwPQ"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwPg"},"children":["["]},"1",{"type":"span","prop